# Hospital Data Analysis Project

## Project Overview

This project focuses on analyzing hospital data to discover useful insights about patient demographics, hospital visits, departments, appointments, diagnoses and treatments.

## Tools Used

* Python
* SQL
* Microsoft Excel
* Power BI

## Project Objectives

1. Analyze patient demographics and hospital visits.
2. Identify the department with the highest patient visits.
3. Analyze appointment completion and cancellation rates.
4. Identify common diagnoses and treatment types.

## Project Files

The folder contains the dataset, Python analysis, SQL queries and Power BI dashboard.

## Project Goal

To use data analysis to discover meaningful insights and support better hospital decision-making.
